  "ruleText": "He-A 906.02 Approval Period. The commissioner shall approve a phase II program provider for a 2-year period following the application process.\n\nSource. #7058, eff 7-21-99; ss by #8902, INTERIM, eff 7-13-07, EXPIRED: 1-9-08\n\nNew. #9082, eff 1-30-08 (from He-A 906.08)",
